 "remarks": "Chic & sophisticated, this stunning 3200SF townhouse, in the beautiful Oak Park complex, offers the best in luxurious carefree living. Special in every way, this unit has a large gracious entrance hall, fabulous living room with fireplace, dining room and gourmet kitchen with high end appliances and island. There are four ensuite bedrooms, a lovely powder room, large study, rec room, mudroom, huge storage room and attached one car garage. With its freshly painted interior, newly refinished hardwood floors, 9 ft. ceilings, deep moldings, fine detailing, expansive bluestone terrace with new privacy fencing and tons of closets, it lives like a house. An extensive list of improvements is available in documents. Sun-drenched and inviting, this exceptional condo is conveniently located close to Mead Park, town and train. A GEM!",
